§1 The rest wait firing while the guest is behind (a stalled guest), then ordinary use
   One straight min-jerk glide at 60 Hz from the page body onto the button; the guest stalls for
   `stall` ms starting within the last 150 ms of the glide; afterwards the user does `after`.
   Reported: trials in which the page showed a hotspot more than one pixel from the truth at any
   time / still at the end (pointer at rest for 3 s), the longest it was shown, the worst error.
